Scout Intent (scout/): written by the Pricise team from the Meterless Scout Intent specification:
  https://github.com/Meterless/Meterless  (engines/scout-intent/AGENTS.md and docs/, commit 1742dec, 2026-10-19)
  Copyright 2026 Meterless, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The specification ships no implementation, and no Meterless code is copied into scout/. The interface, the formula
weights, the confidence bands, the contract shape and the policy-pack names follow the specification.

Files added by the Pricise team for Scout:
  scout/index.ts            Scout class (decide, classify, guard, replan, checkTexts) and verifyContract
  scout/score.ts            intent registry loader and Stage-1 scorer
  scout/guard.ts            five-layer guard (injection, policy, scope, PII, rate limit)
  scout/contract.ts         canonical JSON, ULID, HMAC signing and verification
  scout/packs/*.json        policy packs default, adversarial-tight, pricise (also read by backend/engines/scout.py)
  scout/pricise-intents.json  Pricise intent registry
  server.ts                 changed: adds the /scout/guard and /scout/decide routes
